{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":10,"title":"Manifestation of the absolute","hosts":[{"id":"A","name":"Ava","voice":"en-US-AvaMultilingualNeural"},{"id":"B","name":"Andrew","voice":"en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural"}],"duration":504.264,"segments":[{"title":"Welcome","start":0.0},{"title":"The story","start":33.576},{"title":"Lesson 1 · Every quality from one source","start":354.648},{"title":"Lesson 2 · Seeing leads to loving","start":380.952},{"title":"Lesson 3 · The lamp within","start":402.216},{"title":"Lesson 4 · Beyond full knowing","start":425.592},{"title":"Lesson 5 · A fragment of splendor","start":444.6},{"title":"Wrap-up","start":471.84}],"turns":[{"s":"A","start":0.0,"end":2.832,"text":"Welcome to Shruti. I'm Ava.","L":[],"words":[[0.087,0.537,"Welcome"],[0.637,0.138,"to"],[0.787,0.5,"Shruti"],[1.663,0.275,"I'm"],[1.938,0.525,"Ava"]]},{"s":"B","start":3.12,"end":8.712,"text":"And I'm Andrew. Today, Chapter Ten: Manifestation of the Absolute.","L":[],"words":[[0.1,0.1,"And"],[0.212,0.138,"I'm"],[0.362,0.475,"Andrew"],[1.25,0.45,"Today"],[1.913,0.463,"Chapter"],[2.375,0.438,"Ten"],[3.325,0.975,"Manifestation"],[4.312,0.1,"of"],[4.412,0.1,"the"],[4.525,0.7,"Absolute"]]},{"s":"A","start":9.0,"end":23.328,"text":"Chapter Nine said God has become everything. Chapter Ten answers the obvious follow-up: then where should I look? Krishna gives Arjuna a long, vivid list of the places where the Divine shines brightest.","L":[],"words":[[0.087,0.375,"Chapter"],[0.463,0.287,"Nine"],[0.762,0.237,"said"],[1.012,0.312,"God"],[1.337,0.188,"has"],[1.538,0.412,"become"],[2.375,0.625,"everything"],[3.413,0.45,"Chapter"],[3.875,0.438,"Ten"],[4.425,0.463,"answers"],[4.9,0.113,"the"],[5.075,0.463,"obvious"],[5.55,0.512,"follow-up"],[6.588,0.237,"then"],[6.888,0.15,"where"],[7.05,0.175,"should"],[7.225,0.1,"I"],[7.325,0.338,"look"],[8.05,0.487,"Krishna"],[8.55,0.312,"gives"],[8.875,0.575,"Arjuna"],[9.463,0.062,"a"],[9.537,0.463,"long"],[10.537,0.3,"vivid"],[10.838,0.325,"list"],[11.175,0.05,"of"],[11.225,0.062,"the"],[11.3,0.588,"places"],[12.05,0.15,"where"],[12.213,0.075,"the"],[12.3,0.475,"Divine"],[12.787,0.487,"shines"],[13.287,0.688,"brightest"]]},{"s":"B","start":23.616,"end":32.712,"text":"Five lessons, a wonderful list, and one sentence at the end that puts the whole universe in perspective. Story first.","L":[],"words":[[0.163,0.362,"Five"],[0.537,0.688,"lessons"],[1.375,0.1,"a"],[1.587,0.6,"wonderful"],[2.188,0.475,"list"],[2.875,0.237,"and"],[3.513,0.312,"one"],[3.837,0.438,"sentence"],[4.275,0.075,"at"],[4.35,0.113,"the"],[4.475,0.388,"end"],[5.075,0.175,"that"],[5.25,0.3,"puts"],[5.55,0.113,"the"],[5.662,0.362,"whole"],[6.025,0.588,"universe"],[6.612,0.1,"in"],[6.713,0.787,"perspective"],[7.912,0.312,"Story"],[8.225,0.512,"first"]]},{"s":"A","start":33.576,"end":43.92,"text":"Krishna begins warmly, ten point one: listen once again to My supreme word, that I shall speak to you, who are very dear to Me, for your welfare.","L":[],"words":[[0.1,0.512,"Krishna"],[0.625,0.4,"begins"],[1.038,0.613,"warmly"],[1.913,0.312,"ten"],[2.237,0.312,"point"],[2.55,0.287,"one"],[3.425,0.3,"listen"],[3.737,0.225,"once"],[3.975,0.325,"again"],[4.3,0.1,"to"],[4.412,0.15,"My"],[4.575,0.55,"supreme"],[5.138,0.362,"word"],[5.912,0.113,"that"],[6.037,0.087,"I"],[6.138,0.212,"shall"],[6.362,0.3,"speak"],[6.675,0.1,"to"],[6.787,0.225,"you"],[7.537,0.075,"who"],[7.612,0.138,"are"],[7.763,0.375,"very"],[8.15,0.225,"dear"],[8.375,0.113,"to"],[8.5,0.275,"Me"],[9.137,0.075,"for"],[9.213,0.15,"your"],[9.363,0.637,"welfare"]]},{"s":"B","start":44.208,"end":62.616,"text":"Ten point two: neither the celestial powers nor the great sages know My origin, because I am the origin of all of them. And ten point three: one who knows Me as unborn, beginningless, and the Supreme Lord of the universe is wise, and is freed from Karma.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.1,0.2,"Ten"],[0.3,0.263,"point"],[0.562,0.412,"two"],[1.613,0.263,"neither"],[1.887,0.075,"the"],[1.962,0.55,"celestial"],[2.513,0.625,"powers"],[3.288,0.15,"nor"],[3.438,0.1,"the"],[3.538,0.388,"great"],[3.925,0.675,"sages"],[4.6,0.212,"know"],[4.825,0.2,"My"],[5.075,0.463,"origin"],[5.912,0.388,"because"],[6.312,0.138,"I"],[6.45,0.1,"am"],[6.55,0.125,"the"],[6.737,0.537,"origin"],[7.375,0.15,"of"],[7.537,0.263,"all"],[7.8,0.062,"of"],[7.862,0.237,"them"],[8.5,0.125,"And"],[8.637,0.3,"ten"],[8.938,0.312,"point"],[9.262,0.412,"three"],[10.25,0.163,"one"],[10.412,0.113,"who"],[10.525,0.3,"knows"],[10.825,0.263,"Me"],[11.088,0.237,"as"],[11.338,0.688,"unborn"],[12.425,0.85,"beginningless"],[13.637,0.075,"and"],[13.713,0.062,"the"],[13.787,0.562,"Supreme"],[14.363,0.287,"Lord"],[14.662,0.05,"of"],[14.725,0.037,"the"],[14.762,0.562,"universe"],[15.338,0.087,"is"],[15.425,0.7,"wise"],[16.512,0.1,"and"],[16.625,0.125,"is"],[16.75,0.55,"freed"],[17.3,0.175,"from"],[17.488,0.537,"Karma"]]},{"s":"A","start":62.904,"end":88.608,"text":"Then a list of human qualities, ten point four and five: intelligence, Self-knowledge, non-delusion, forgiveness, truthfulness, self-control, tranquility, pleasure, pain, birth, death, fear, fearlessness, nonviolence, contentment, austerity, charity, fame, ill fame. These diverse qualities in human beings also arise from Me.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.087,0.25,"Then"],[0.35,0.062,"a"],[0.412,0.338,"list"],[0.762,0.062,"of"],[0.838,0.287,"human"],[1.137,0.6,"qualities"],[2.025,0.263,"ten"],[2.3,0.287,"point"],[2.6,0.475,"four"],[3.075,0.125,"and"],[3.212,0.45,"five"],[4.188,0.75,"intelligence"],[5.138,0.825,"Self-knowledge"],[6.188,0.812,"non-delusion"],[7.188,0.637,"forgiveness"],[8.037,0.7,"truthfulness"],[9.088,0.725,"self-control"],[10.188,0.7,"tranquility"],[11.137,0.5,"pleasure"],[11.825,0.475,"pain"],[12.713,0.388,"birth"],[13.5,0.4,"death"],[14.275,0.5,"fear"],[15.188,0.75,"fearlessness"],[16.125,0.787,"nonviolence"],[17.075,0.65,"contentment"],[17.9,0.675,"austerity"],[18.988,0.512,"charity"],[19.887,0.412,"fame"],[20.725,0.175,"ill"],[20.913,0.5,"fame"],[21.788,0.225,"These"],[22.012,0.375,"diverse"],[22.387,0.613,"qualities"],[23.012,0.125,"in"],[23.15,0.325,"human"],[23.475,0.475,"beings"],[24.0,0.4,"also"],[24.413,0.425,"arise"],[24.85,0.163,"from"],[25.025,0.312,"Me"]]},{"s":"B","start":88.896,"end":97.536,"text":"Notice that it's not only the nice ones. Pain, fear and ill fame are on the list too. Everything we go through comes from the same source.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.087,0.275,"Notice"],[0.375,0.1,"that"],[0.475,0.113,"it's"],[0.588,0.338,"not"],[0.938,0.263,"only"],[1.2,0.075,"the"],[1.275,0.362,"nice"],[1.637,0.487,"ones"],[2.525,0.338,"Pain"],[3.275,0.475,"fear"],[3.875,0.087,"and"],[3.962,0.188,"ill"],[4.15,0.338,"fame"],[4.6,0.087,"are"],[4.688,0.087,"on"],[4.775,0.05,"the"],[4.825,0.25,"list"],[5.075,0.3,"too"],[5.75,0.3,"Everything"],[6.05,0.113,"we"],[6.162,0.225,"go"],[6.388,0.25,"through"],[6.65,0.412,"comes"],[7.062,0.138,"from"],[7.2,0.062,"the"],[7.263,0.362,"same"],[7.638,0.637,"source"]]},{"s":"A","start":97.824,"end":114.072,"text":"Ten point seven and eight: one who truly understands My manifestations is united with Me by unswerving devotion. I am the origin of all; everything emanates from Me. Understanding this, the wise adore Me with love.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.1,0.25,"Ten"],[0.35,0.287,"point"],[0.65,0.425,"seven"],[1.087,0.175,"and"],[1.35,0.312,"eight"],[2.225,0.237,"one"],[2.475,0.175,"who"],[2.663,0.5,"truly"],[3.175,0.637,"understands"],[3.825,0.175,"My"],[4.013,0.95,"manifestations"],[4.975,0.138,"is"],[5.125,0.487,"united"],[5.612,0.15,"with"],[5.775,0.263,"Me"],[6.05,0.287,"by"],[6.4,0.725,"unswerving"],[7.138,0.613,"devotion"],[8.15,0.375,"I"],[8.838,0.138,"am"],[8.975,0.1,"the"],[9.15,0.475,"origin"],[9.625,0.113,"of"],[9.75,0.412,"all"],[10.738,0.438,"everything"],[11.188,0.438,"emanates"],[11.637,0.138,"from"],[11.775,0.3,"Me"],[12.463,0.675,"Understanding"],[13.137,0.362,"this"],[13.9,0.15,"the"],[14.05,0.487,"wise"],[14.55,0.4,"adore"],[14.963,0.212,"Me"],[15.188,0.175,"with"],[15.375,0.5,"love"]]},{"s":"B","start":114.36,"end":127.272,"text":"And a lovely picture of a spiritual community, ten point nine: My devotees remain ever content and delighted, their minds absorbed in Me, and they always enlighten each other by talking about Me.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.087,0.087,"And"],[0.188,0.05,"a"],[0.25,0.475,"lovely"],[0.725,0.7,"picture"],[1.438,0.075,"of"],[1.512,0.05,"a"],[1.562,0.588,"spiritual"],[2.163,0.6,"community"],[3.038,0.312,"ten"],[3.362,0.3,"point"],[3.663,0.362,"nine"],[4.588,0.1,"My"],[4.688,0.537,"devotees"],[5.237,0.55,"remain"],[5.912,0.275,"ever"],[6.188,0.613,"content"],[6.938,0.087,"and"],[7.025,0.562,"delighted"],[7.987,0.15,"their"],[8.137,0.425,"minds"],[8.562,0.55,"absorbed"],[9.113,0.125,"in"],[9.238,0.287,"Me"],[10.037,0.1,"and"],[10.137,0.125,"they"],[10.262,0.45,"always"],[10.725,0.475,"enlighten"],[11.2,0.15,"each"],[11.363,0.163,"other"],[11.525,0.087,"by"],[11.625,0.388,"talking"],[12.012,0.263,"about"],[12.287,0.275,"Me"]]},{"s":"A","start":127.56,"end":145.8,"text":"Then a promise, ten point ten and eleven: to those who are ever united with Me and lovingly adore Me, I give the understanding by which they come to Me. Dwelling within them as consciousness, I destroy the darkness born of ignorance by the shining lamp of knowledge, as an act of compassion.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.075,0.188,"Then"],[0.263,0.062,"a"],[0.325,0.675,"promise"],[1.262,0.287,"ten"],[1.562,0.325,"point"],[1.887,0.412,"ten"],[2.312,0.1,"and"],[2.413,0.438,"eleven"],[3.362,0.087,"to"],[3.462,0.3,"those"],[3.775,0.075,"who"],[3.85,0.15,"are"],[4.013,0.2,"ever"],[4.225,0.45,"united"],[4.688,0.163,"with"],[4.862,0.375,"Me"],[5.25,0.188,"and"],[5.45,0.4,"lovingly"],[5.862,0.35,"adore"],[6.225,0.275,"Me"],[6.938,0.138,"I"],[7.088,0.212,"give"],[7.312,0.1,"the"],[7.425,0.713,"understanding"],[8.15,0.163,"by"],[8.325,0.188,"which"],[8.525,0.125,"they"],[8.662,0.212,"come"],[8.887,0.1,"to"],[9.0,0.287,"Me"],[9.675,0.412,"Dwelling"],[10.1,0.3,"within"],[10.412,0.212,"them"],[10.675,0.188,"as"],[10.875,0.75,"consciousness"],[12.162,0.062,"I"],[12.238,0.5,"destroy"],[12.738,0.1,"the"],[12.85,0.475,"darkness"],[13.325,0.275,"born"],[13.613,0.075,"of"],[13.75,0.512,"ignorance"],[14.275,0.125,"by"],[14.412,0.1,"the"],[14.525,0.55,"shining"],[15.088,0.275,"lamp"],[15.375,0.1,"of"],[15.488,0.55,"knowledge"],[16.45,0.138,"as"],[16.6,0.138,"an"],[16.837,0.275,"act"],[17.113,0.075,"of"],[17.2,0.675,"compassion"]]},{"s":"B","start":146.088,"end":166.656,"text":"Arjuna is moved. Ten point twelve to fifteen: You are the Supreme Being, the Supreme Abode, the primal God, unborn and everywhere. All the sages said so, and now You tell me Yourself. Neither gods nor demons fully understand You. You alone know Yourself by Yourself.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.087,0.613,"Arjuna"],[0.775,0.15,"is"],[0.938,0.512,"moved"],[1.85,0.175,"Ten"],[2.025,0.25,"point"],[2.275,0.525,"twelve"],[2.975,0.125,"to"],[3.1,0.662,"fifteen"],[4.312,0.087,"You"],[4.412,0.1,"are"],[4.513,0.087,"the"],[4.612,0.525,"Supreme"],[5.138,0.425,"Being"],[5.75,0.075,"the"],[5.825,0.512,"Supreme"],[6.338,0.487,"Abode"],[7.213,0.1,"the"],[7.312,0.388,"primal"],[7.7,0.412,"God"],[8.637,0.675,"unborn"],[9.55,0.163,"and"],[9.725,0.75,"everywhere"],[10.887,0.113,"All"],[11.0,0.075,"the"],[11.075,0.438,"sages"],[11.512,0.3,"said"],[11.812,0.438,"so"],[12.662,0.188,"and"],[12.863,0.25,"now"],[13.113,0.15,"You"],[13.275,0.2,"tell"],[13.488,0.062,"me"],[13.55,0.6,"Yourself"],[14.537,0.312,"Neither"],[14.85,0.675,"gods"],[15.738,0.225,"nor"],[15.975,0.463,"demons"],[16.45,0.512,"fully"],[16.962,0.537,"understand"],[17.5,0.225,"You"],[18.137,0.125,"You"],[18.262,0.4,"alone"],[18.675,0.188,"know"],[18.863,0.562,"Yourself"],[19.425,0.113,"by"],[19.538,0.662,"Yourself"]]},{"s":"A","start":166.944,"end":184.32,"text":"And then his very personal question, ten point seventeen: how may I know You by constant contemplation? In what forms am I to think of You? Ten point eighteen: tell me again, in detail, because I am not satiated by hearing Your nectar-like words.","L":[],"words":[[0.075,0.125,"And"],[0.2,0.212,"then"],[0.412,0.212,"his"],[0.637,0.438,"very"],[1.087,0.438,"personal"],[1.538,0.55,"question"],[2.475,0.25,"ten"],[2.737,0.25,"point"],[3.0,0.637,"seventeen"],[4.287,0.125,"how"],[4.425,0.175,"may"],[4.612,0.087,"I"],[4.7,0.35,"know"],[5.062,0.25,"You"],[5.325,0.2,"by"],[5.537,0.5,"constant"],[6.037,0.8,"contemplation"],[7.237,0.125,"In"],[7.375,0.175,"what"],[7.562,0.588,"forms"],[8.162,0.212,"am"],[8.387,0.087,"I"],[8.488,0.087,"to"],[8.588,0.287,"think"],[8.887,0.062,"of"],[8.963,0.338,"You"],[9.7,0.263,"Ten"],[9.975,0.25,"point"],[10.238,0.537,"eighteen"],[11.262,0.188,"tell"],[11.463,0.1,"me"],[11.575,0.45,"again"],[12.375,0.125,"in"],[12.512,0.537,"detail"],[13.412,0.4,"because"],[13.825,0.15,"I"],[13.988,0.138,"am"],[14.125,0.225,"not"],[14.363,0.688,"satiated"],[15.062,0.138,"by"],[15.213,0.463,"hearing"],[15.675,0.113,"Your"],[15.8,0.6,"nectar-like"],[16.413,0.613,"words"]]},{"s":"B","start":184.608,"end":194.904,"text":"Krishna's answer is a list, and he warns first, ten point nineteen: I shall tell you My prominent manifestations, because My manifestations are endless.","L":["L5"],"words":[[0.1,0.45,"Krishna's"],[0.562,0.463,"answer"],[1.038,0.138,"is"],[1.175,0.037,"a"],[1.212,0.537,"list"],[2.025,0.062,"and"],[2.087,0.087,"he"],[2.175,0.362,"warns"],[2.538,0.588,"first"],[3.362,0.275,"ten"],[3.638,0.275,"point"],[3.913,0.562,"nineteen"],[5.062,0.025,"I"],[5.088,0.188,"shall"],[5.275,0.225,"tell"],[5.5,0.125,"you"],[5.625,0.15,"My"],[5.787,0.512,"prominent"],[6.3,0.975,"manifestations"],[7.287,0.325,"because"],[7.612,0.113,"My"],[7.725,1.2,"manifestations"],[8.938,0.275,"are"],[9.338,0.6,"endless"]]},{"s":"A","start":195.192,"end":205.296,"text":"Ten point twenty: I am the Spirit abiding in the heart of all beings. I am the beginning, the middle, and the end of all beings.","L":[],"words":[[0.087,0.25,"Ten"],[0.35,0.263,"point"],[0.613,0.412,"twenty"],[1.613,0.35,"I"],[2.275,0.138,"am"],[2.413,0.087,"the"],[2.513,0.425,"Spirit"],[2.95,0.537,"abiding"],[3.5,0.087,"in"],[3.6,0.05,"the"],[3.663,0.45,"heart"],[4.188,0.138,"of"],[4.425,0.212,"all"],[4.65,0.688,"beings"],[5.737,0.325,"I"],[6.125,0.175,"am"],[6.312,0.075,"the"],[6.4,0.475,"beginning"],[7.263,0.075,"the"],[7.35,0.438,"middle"],[8.037,0.087,"and"],[8.137,0.075,"the"],[8.225,0.375,"end"],[8.613,0.138,"of"],[8.825,0.225,"all"],[9.062,0.662,"beings"]]},{"s":"B","start":205.584,"end":221.76,"text":"And then: I am the radiant sun among the luminaries, the moon among the stars. I am the mind among the senses, the consciousness in living beings. I am the ocean among the bodies of water. I am the Himalaya among the mountains.","L":["L5"],"words":[[0.1,0.113,"And"],[0.212,0.375,"then"],[1.163,0.1,"I"],[1.288,0.075,"am"],[1.363,0.113,"the"],[1.475,0.425,"radiant"],[1.9,0.487,"sun"],[2.55,0.263,"among"],[2.825,0.087,"the"],[2.925,0.762,"luminaries"],[4.05,0.1,"the"],[4.15,0.362,"moon"],[4.513,0.287,"among"],[4.8,0.062,"the"],[4.875,0.688,"stars"],[5.975,0.113,"I"],[6.1,0.125,"am"],[6.237,0.062,"the"],[6.3,0.588,"mind"],[6.975,0.263,"among"],[7.237,0.075,"the"],[7.312,0.787,"senses"],[8.312,0.113,"the"],[8.438,0.988,"consciousness"],[9.55,0.163,"in"],[9.713,0.275,"living"],[10.0,0.675,"beings"],[11.075,0.075,"I"],[11.162,0.113,"am"],[11.275,0.113,"the"],[11.4,0.45,"ocean"],[11.938,0.237,"among"],[12.175,0.075,"the"],[12.262,0.412,"bodies"],[12.675,0.075,"of"],[12.75,0.438,"water"],[13.6,0.1,"I"],[13.713,0.1,"am"],[13.812,0.062,"the"],[13.875,0.738,"Himalaya"],[14.787,0.287,"among"],[15.088,0.062,"the"],[15.15,0.675,"mountains"]]},{"s":"A","start":222.048,"end":236.232,"text":"Ten point twenty-five, in our book's rendering: I am the monosyllable cosmic sound, Om, Amin, Allah, among the words. I am the silent repetition of a mantra among the spiritual disciplines.","L":["L5"],"words":[[0.087,0.263,"Ten"],[0.362,0.275,"point"],[0.65,0.675,"twenty-five"],[1.538,0.125,"in"],[1.663,0.113,"our"],[1.788,0.275,"book's"],[2.075,0.475,"rendering"],[3.163,0.212,"I"],[3.388,0.188,"am"],[3.587,0.062,"the"],[3.65,0.725,"monosyllable"],[4.388,0.438,"cosmic"],[4.838,0.487,"sound"],[5.588,0.463,"Om"],[6.25,0.425,"Amin"],[6.987,0.388,"Allah"],[7.55,0.287,"among"],[7.85,0.087,"the"],[7.938,0.537,"words"],[8.875,0.438,"I"],[9.625,0.15,"am"],[9.775,0.087,"the"],[9.875,0.425,"silent"],[10.312,0.662,"repetition"],[10.988,0.113,"of"],[11.113,0.075,"a"],[11.188,0.637,"mantra"],[12.1,0.263,"among"],[12.375,0.062,"the"],[12.45,0.613,"spiritual"],[13.075,0.738,"disciplines"]]},{"s":"B","start":236.52,"end":246.048,"text":"That's this book's own choice, to place Amen and Allah beside Om, in line with the commentary's habit of drawing on all the world's scriptures.","L":[],"words":[[0.1,0.175,"That's"],[0.275,0.163,"this"],[0.438,0.475,"book's"],[1.062,0.212,"own"],[1.275,0.625,"choice"],[2.1,0.087,"to"],[2.188,0.375,"place"],[2.7,0.45,"Amen"],[3.4,0.175,"and"],[3.587,0.325,"Allah"],[3.913,0.512,"beside"],[4.425,0.45,"Om"],[5.287,0.175,"in"],[5.463,0.312,"line"],[5.775,0.113,"with"],[5.888,0.087,"the"],[5.987,0.625,"commentary's"],[6.612,0.325,"habit"],[6.95,0.087,"of"],[7.037,0.5,"drawing"],[7.7,0.188,"on"],[7.9,0.2,"all"],[8.113,0.075,"the"],[8.188,0.3,"world's"],[8.488,0.675,"scriptures"]]},{"s":"A","start":246.336,"end":259.44,"text":"More from the list: I am the holy fig tree among the trees, the lion among the beasts, the king of birds among birds, the Ganga among the rivers. And among warriors, Lord Rama.","L":["L5"],"words":[[0.1,0.287,"More"],[0.4,0.138,"from"],[0.55,0.075,"the"],[0.637,0.412,"list"],[1.663,0.138,"I"],[1.8,0.175,"am"],[1.988,0.062,"the"],[2.062,0.438,"holy"],[2.513,0.412,"fig"],[2.925,0.287,"tree"],[3.225,0.237,"among"],[3.475,0.062,"the"],[3.55,0.5,"trees"],[4.463,0.15,"the"],[4.625,0.35,"lion"],[4.987,0.25,"among"],[5.25,0.075,"the"],[5.338,0.512,"beasts"],[6.237,0.087,"the"],[6.338,0.325,"king"],[